64	## Before you go on stage
65	
66	- **Pre-seed the graph** the night before, not live -- seeding calls the
67	  embedding API 6 times and isn't interesting to watch. What's interesting
68	  is the retriever and the scorer, which is what's worth live-coding.
69	- **Record a backup run.** Capture the terminal output of a full,
70	  successful `mvn compile exec:java` run (screen recording or just the
71	  scrollback) in case live network/API flakiness eats your demo window.
72	- **Warm the JVM / Maven cache** beforehand: run the full flow once before
73	  the session so dependency downloads and JIT warm-up don't eat your
74	  30 minutes.
75	- Double-check the version pins in `pom.xml` -- see the comment block
76	  there. `langchain4j-community-neo4j*` are beta artifacts that ship
77	  frequently; a mismatch between the core `langchain4j` version and the
78	  community modules is the most common source of a `NoSuchMethodError` at
79	  runtime, and won't necessarily show up at compile time.
